          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "امتحان (imtihān) is a loan from Arabic imtiḥān, \"a test, a trial\", which reached Urdu through Persian. Its Arabic root is m-ḥ-n (Lane)."
            }
          ]
        },
